== Airlines and destinations ==
=== Passenger ===
Effective December 19, 2021, [[SkyWest Airlines]], operating as [[United Express]], began nonstop service to the airport. Daily flights to [[San Francisco International Airport|San Francisco]] and [[Denver International Airport|Denver]] commenced in December 2022.

