=== Historical airline service ===
According to the [[Official Airline Guide]] (OAG), the Wabush Airport was served by several airlines operating scheduled passenger jet flights during the 1970s including [[Eastern Provincial Airways]] operating [[Boeing 737-200]] jets with nonstop flights from [[Churchill Falls, Labrador]] and [[Goose Bay, Labrador]].

